      en: ["The plant commenced operations in 1959.", "It is owned and operated by CMPC.", "Located at the confluence of the Laja and Biobío rivers.", "Utilizes radiata pine as the primary raw material.", "Produces both bleached and unbleached kraft pulp.", "Significant contributor to regional industrial GDP."],
